*** Add File:ops/ml/deepspeed/README.md
+DeepSpeed & Multi-node Training Support (Aegis)
+
+This directory contains example PyTorchJob manifests, launcher scripts and example DeepSpeed JSON configs.
+It is provider-agnostic and uses placeholders for images, registry and PVCs. Replace placeholders with your cloud specifics.
+
+Environment variables to set (examples):
+ - MODEL_SIZE: "13B" or "70B"
+ - DEEPSPEED_IMAGE: "<YOUR_REGISTRY>/aegis-deepspeed:latest"
+ - SHARD_MANIFEST: path to shard manifest in the cluster PVC
+ - NUM_NODES, GPUS_PER_NODE
+ - NCCL_DEBUG, NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME (set in k8s env or node env)
+ - COSIGN_KMS_URI (for signing artifacts)
+
+Runbook:
+ - Deploy PyTorchJob manifest (adapt replica counts) or use launch_deepspeed.sh from a job container as entrypoint.
+ - Validate NCCL connectivity and run a small multi-node torch.distributed smoke.
+
